4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kOYY9-MGmxAQ7kNvwFSxEKo&_nc_oc=AdqNhGLEI3VQrhxBX3uxQw83nWmo7m9LEuf8zkgQgLTTWPsYpC8ayRpv39Ei_KYBdao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJNtfZ6I_5uX_Hjyq8Qc1vaF_a1iZgcX7ADXD_RckL6pg&oe=6AAD36D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQMoCMwHKUcQ7kNvwGnVVZs&_nc_oc=AdqFMc56clt7sO4H5xyGcDlVN_AL1d1mxYOgledlRHZOW_GJ_xzxWIjf694VX0Wg8w0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLnD0bIW8erUGWsl537aDES6ybHhzF5UEYJbyhBvBPVLA&oe=6AAD3BB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Sy_dthrNg9sQ7kNvwFHcAG4&_nc_oc=AdpkT5S5rS_JW4p1FwhhQuEHeXweuIbsu51rMWd2668dFQkMF9sG0Gkuot-bpahXroc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLOg7-GMJ6A9jHhJjCUOkAJV_rEdWBdgpM2oyl6Kz-CLQ&oe=6AAD4955"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p